   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till IWPR&apos;s rapporter fr&#xe5;n Haagtribunalen samt till  deras bakgrundsanalyser om kriserna p&#xe5; Balkan. Rapporter  publiceras p&#xe5; serbiska och engelska via e-mail och p&#xe5; Internet. Projektet omfattar ocks&#xe5; utbildning av unga journalister.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to IWPR&apos;s reporting from the Hague Tribunal and to their background analyses of the crisis in the Balkans. Reports are published in Serbian and English via e-mail and Internet. The project also includes training of young journalists.</narrative>
